msgid "· 统领：本大轮出战龟　小将：补位单位\n· 上路、下路独立作战\n· 依次点击两个单位，或把一个拖到另一个上：交换位置\n· 小将卡上【前排 / 后排】：切换近战 / 远程\n· 右上「站位」：拖动单位设置开战站位\n· 点击单位：查看属性；点击单位身上的装备：卸下\n· 选择背包装备后点击单位，或拖动装备到单位：装备\n· 3 件同名同星装备自动合成升星"
msgstr "· Leaders: your turtles this Season. Minions: fill-in units\n· Top and Bottom Lanes fight separately\n· Tap two units in turn, or drag one onto another: swap positions\n· [Front / Back] on a Minion card: switch Melee / Ranged\n· \"Positions\" (top right): drag units to set starting positions\n· Tap a unit: view stats. Tap an item on a unit: unequip it\n· Pick an item from the Inventory, then tap a unit (or drag it onto a unit): equip\n· 3 copies of the same item at the same star level combine into a higher star"

