msgstr "Spirit · Summoner"

msgid "遗物·古物"
msgstr "Relic · Antiquity"

msgid "香火·刻痕"
msgstr "Incense · Engraving"

msgid "斧头·砍伐"
msgstr "Axe · Chopping"

msgid "剑提高携带者的攻击力，并让携带者攻击后追打目标。全队单位生命值越低，攻击力越高。"
msgstr "Swords grant attack damage and make the holder follow up after attacking. The lower your team's health, the higher its attack damage."

msgid "奇械提高携带者的魔抗，并为全队铸造深海币。档位越高，全队攻击越能冰封敌人。"
msgstr "Gadgets grant magic resist and mint Abyss Coins for the team. Higher tiers let your team's attacks freeze enemies."

msgid "队伍里每件装备为携带者提供最大生命值，食物提供双倍。食物还让最大生命值在战斗中持续成长。"
msgstr "Every item on your team gives the holder max health; Food gives double. Food also keeps growing max health during battle."

msgid "盾提高携带者的护甲。全队承受伤害后对敌人释放冲击波，并获得圣光护盾装备。"
msgstr "Shields grant armor. As your team takes damage, it releases shockwaves at enemies, and you gain Holy Light Shield items."

msgid "药水提高携带者的治疗与护盾强度。全队集火被标记的猎物，击杀猎物后攻击力提高。"
msgstr "Potions grant Heal Power and Shield Power. Your team focuses the marked Prey and gains attack damage after killing it."

msgid "枪提高携带者的攻击速度。每把枪定期射出金弹，档位越高，我方生成的炮台越多。"
msgstr "Guns grant attack speed. Each gun periodically fires a Golden Bullet. Higher tiers build more turrets for your side."

msgid "弓箭提高携带者的暴击率。全队攻击可处决低生命值的敌人，并持续腐蚀敌方全体。"
msgstr "Bows grant Crit Chance. Your team's attacks execute low-health enemies and steadily corrode the whole enemy team."

msgid "法器提高携带者的魔法穿透与最大龟能。每件法器充满法力后释放自己的主动效果，档位越高充满越快。"
msgstr "Artifacts grant Magic Pen and max Energy. Each Artifact casts its own active effect when its mana is full; higher tiers fill faster."

msgid "灵物提高携带者的闪避。无法被击杀的触手为我方作战，阵亡的友军化为亡魂继续战斗。"
msgstr "Spirits grant Dodge. Unkillable tentacles fight for your side, and fallen allies rise as wraiths to keep fighting."

msgid "香火石的携带者造成伤害时刻下刻痕。刻痕跨对局保留，每道刻痕永久提高全队的增伤与减伤。"
msgstr "The Incense Stone's holder carves Engravings by dealing damage. Engravings carry over between matches, and each one permanently raises your team's Damage Amp and Damage Reduction."

msgid "装备小木斧即激活。激活后商店更容易刷出小木斧。"
msgstr "Activates when a Little Wooden Axe is equipped. Once active, the shop offers Little Wooden Axes more often."

msgid "遗物提供生命偷取。我方全体单位按生命值高低切换攻击与续航，全队增伤随战斗时间累积，龟蛋也加入战斗。"
msgstr "Relics grant Lifesteal. Your units switch between offense and sustain based on their health, your team's Damage Amp builds over time, and your Turtle Egg joins the fight."

msgid "每件剑为携带者提供 +8 攻击力 · 【剑士】携带者每次攻击后追打目标 {C:SwordsmanSystem.HITS[0]} 次，身上每件剑使追打造成 {C:SwordsmanSystem.PCT[0]%}% 攻击伤害。追打速度为攻击速度的 {C:SwordsmanSystem.ASPD_MULT%}%，每次追打都视为一次攻击，触发攻击时与命中时的装备效果 · 【血祭】全队单位每损失 1% 生命值，攻击力提高 {C:SynergySystem.BLOOD_RITE[0]}%"
msgstr "Each Sword gives its holder +8 Attack · [Swordsman] After each attack, the holder strikes the target {C:SwordsmanSystem.HITS[0]} more times; each Sword on it makes follow-ups deal {C:SwordsmanSystem.PCT[0]%}% attack damage. Follow-ups happen at {C:SwordsmanSystem.ASPD_MULT%}% of attack speed and count as attacks, triggering on-attack and on-hit item effects · [Blood Rite] For every 1% health your units have lost, they gain {C:SynergySystem.BLOOD_RITE[0]}% attack damage"

msgid "每件剑为携带者提供 +15 攻击力 · 【剑士】身上每件剑使追打造成 {C:SwordsmanSystem.PCT[1]%}% 攻击伤害 · 【血祭】每损失 1% 生命值，攻击力提高 {C:SynergySystem.BLOOD_RITE[1]}%"
msgstr "Each Sword gives its holder +15 Attack · [Swordsman] Each Sword on the holder makes follow-ups deal {C:SwordsmanSystem.PCT[1]%}% attack damage · [Blood Rite] +{C:SynergySystem.BLOOD_RITE[1]}% attack damage for every 1% health lost"

msgid "每件剑为携带者提供 +25 攻击力 · 【剑士】追打 {C:SwordsmanSystem.HITS[2]} 次，身上每件剑使每次追打造成 {C:SwordsmanSystem.PCT[2]%}% 攻击伤害 · 【血祭】每损失 1% 生命值，攻击力提高 {C:SynergySystem.BLOOD_RITE[2]}%"
msgstr "Each Sword gives its holder +25 Attack · [Swordsman] {C:SwordsmanSystem.HITS[2]} follow-up strikes; each Sword on the holder makes each one deal {C:SwordsmanSystem.PCT[2]%}% attack damage · [Blood Rite] +{C:SynergySystem.BLOOD_RITE[2]}% attack damage for every 1% health lost"

msgid "每件奇械为携带者提供 +4 魔抗 · 【铸币】每 {C:GadgetSynergySystem.PERIOD} 秒铸造 {C:GadgetSynergySystem.COIN_PER_TICK[0]} 枚深海币，每局至多 {C:GadgetSynergySystem.COIN_CAP[0]} 枚，本局结束时获得"
msgstr "Each Gadget gives its holder +4 Magic Resist · [Minting] Mints {C:GadgetSynergySystem.COIN_PER_TICK[0]} Abyss Coins every {C:GadgetSynergySystem.PERIOD} seconds, up to {C:GadgetSynergySystem.COIN_CAP[0]} per match, paid out when the match ends"

msgid "每件奇械为携带者提供 +10 魔抗 · 【铸币】每次铸造 {C:GadgetSynergySystem.COIN_PER_TICK[1]} 枚，每局至多 {C:GadgetSynergySystem.COIN_CAP[1]} 枚 · 【冰封】全队攻击有 {C:GadgetSynergySystem.FREEZE_CHANCE[1]%}% 概率冰封目标 {C:GadgetSynergySystem.FREEZE_SEC} 秒。同一目标每 {C:GadgetSynergySystem.FREEZE_CD} 秒至多被冰封 1 次，冰封结束后 {C:GadgetSynergySystem.FREEZE_IMMUNE} 秒内免疫冰封"
msgstr "Each Gadget gives its holder +10 Magic Resist · [Minting] {C:GadgetSynergySystem.COIN_PER_TICK[1]} coins each time, up to {C:GadgetSynergySystem.COIN_CAP[1]} per match · [Freeze] Your team's attacks have a {C:GadgetSynergySystem.FREEZE_CHANCE[1]%}% chance to freeze the target for {C:GadgetSynergySystem.FREEZE_SEC} seconds. A target can be frozen at most once every {C:GadgetSynergySystem.FREEZE_CD} seconds and is immune to freezing for {C:GadgetSynergySystem.FREEZE_IMMUNE} seconds afterward"

msgid "每件奇械为携带者提供 +16 魔抗 · 【铸币】每次铸造 {C:GadgetSynergySystem.COIN_PER_TICK[2]} 枚，每局至多 {C:GadgetSynergySystem.COIN_CAP[2]} 枚 · 【冰封】概率提高至 {C:GadgetSynergySystem.FREEZE_CHANCE[2]%}%"
msgstr "Each Gadget gives its holder +16 Magic Resist · [Minting] {C:GadgetSynergySystem.COIN_PER_TICK[2]} coins each time, up to {C:GadgetSynergySystem.COIN_CAP[2]} per match · [Freeze] Chance increased to {C:GadgetSynergySystem.FREEZE_CHANCE[2]%}%"

msgid "每件奇械为携带者提供 +23 魔抗 · 【铸币】每局至多 {C:GadgetSynergySystem.COIN_CAP[3]} 枚 · 【冰封】概率提高至 {C:GadgetSynergySystem.FREEZE_CHANCE[3]%}%"
msgstr "Each Gadget gives its holder +23 Magic Resist · [Minting] Up to {C:GadgetSynergySystem.COIN_CAP[3]} coins per match · [Freeze] Chance increased to {C:GadgetSynergySystem.FREEZE_CHANCE[3]%}%"

msgid "队伍每件装备为携带者提供 +30 最大生命值，每件食物 +60 · 【成长】每 {C:FoodSynergySystem.PERIOD} 秒，每件食物使携带者永久 +{C:FoodSynergySystem.GROW_PER_FOOD[0]} 最大生命值，无上限，持续到本局结束"
msgstr "Each item on your team gives its holder +30 Max Health, each Food +60 · [Growth] Every {C:FoodSynergySystem.PERIOD} seconds, each Food permanently gives its holder +{C:FoodSynergySystem.GROW_PER_FOOD[0]} Max Health, with no cap, until the match ends"

msgid "队伍每件装备为携带者提供 +70 最大生命值，每件食物 +140 · 【成长】每次 +{C:FoodSynergySystem.GROW_PER_FOOD[1]} 最大生命值 · 【学院】全队 +{C:FoodSynergySystem.ACADEMY[1]} 最大生命值"
msgstr "Each item on your team gives its holder +70 Max Health, each Food +140 · [Growth] +{C:FoodSynergySystem.GROW_PER_FOOD[1]} Max Health each time · [Academy] Whole team +{C:FoodSynergySystem.ACADEMY[1]} Max Health"

msgid "队伍每件装备为携带者提供 +130 最大生命值，每件食物 +260 · 【成长】每次 +{C:FoodSynergySystem.GROW_PER_FOOD[2]} 最大生命值 · 【学院】全队 +{C:FoodSynergySystem.ACADEMY[2]} 最大生命值 · 【盛宴】每 {C:SynergySystem.PULSE} 秒，全队回复 {C:SynergySystem.FEAST_PCT[2]%}% 已损失生命值"
msgstr "Each item on your team gives its holder +130 Max Health, each Food +260 · [Growth] +{C:FoodSynergySystem.GROW_PER_FOOD[2]} Max Health each time · [Academy] Whole team +{C:FoodSynergySystem.ACADEMY[2]} Max Health · [Feast] Every {C:SynergySystem.PULSE} seconds, your team heals {C:SynergySystem.FEAST_PCT[2]%}% of missing health"

msgid "每件盾为携带者提供 +5 护甲 · 【怒气】全队单位每受到 {C:ShieldSynergySystem.RAGE_THRESHOLD} 点伤害，对最近的敌人释放冲击波，造成 {C:ShieldSynergySystem.WAVE_PCT[0]%}% 自身最大生命值的真实伤害，并获得该伤害 {C:ShieldSynergySystem.SHIELD_FROM_DMG%}% 的护盾 · 【圣光护盾】获得 1 件圣光护盾装备，不占装备位，档位降低时收回。携带者 +250 最大生命值，每 {C:ShieldSynergySystem.HOLY_PERIOD} 秒获得 {C:ShieldSynergySystem.HOLY_AMOUNT} 点圣光护盾值。有圣光护盾值时，每段受到的伤害对攻击者造成 {C:ShieldSynergySystem.RIPOSTE_FLAT} 点真实伤害"
msgstr "Each Shield gives its holder +5 Armor · [Rage] For every {C:ShieldSynergySystem.RAGE_THRESHOLD} damage a unit on your team takes, it releases a shockwave at the nearest enemy, dealing true damage equal to {C:ShieldSynergySystem.WAVE_PCT[0]%}% of its own max health and gaining a shield for {C:ShieldSynergySystem.SHIELD_FROM_DMG%}% of that damage · [Holy Light Shield] Gain 1 Holy Light Shield item. It takes no item slot and is removed if the tier drops. Holder gets +250 Max Health and {C:ShieldSynergySystem.HOLY_AMOUNT} Holy Shield every {C:ShieldSynergySystem.HOLY_PERIOD} seconds. While it has Holy Shield, each hit taken deals {C:ShieldSynergySystem.RIPOSTE_FLAT} true damage to the attacker"

msgid "每件盾为携带者提供 +13 护甲 · 【怒气】冲击波伤害提高至 {C:ShieldSynergySystem.WAVE_PCT[1]%}% 自身最大生命值 · 【圣光护盾】再获得 1 件，共 2 件 · 【收殓】敌方单位阵亡时，最近的携带盾者获得相当于该单位 {C:ShieldSynergySystem.REAP_PCT%}% 最大生命值的护盾"
msgstr "Each Shield gives its holder +13 Armor · [Rage] Shockwave damage increased to {C:ShieldSynergySystem.WAVE_PCT[1]%}% of own max health · [Holy Light Shield] Gain 1 more, 2 in total · [Reap] When an enemy unit dies, the nearest Shield holder gains a shield equal to {C:ShieldSynergySystem.REAP_PCT%}% of that unit's max health"

msgid "每件盾为携带者提供 +22 护甲 · 【怒气】冲击波伤害提高至 {C:ShieldSynergySystem.WAVE_PCT[2]%}% 自身最大生命值 · 【圣光·强化】盾类装备提供护盾或治疗时，额外提供其 {C:ShieldSynergySystem.T3_CONVERT%}% 的圣光护盾值。圣光护盾装备生成的圣光护盾值提高 {C:ShieldSynergySystem.T3_SHIELD_BONUS%}%"
msgstr "Each Shield gives its holder +22 Armor · [Rage] Shockwave damage increased to {C:ShieldSynergySystem.WAVE_PCT[2]%}% of own max health · [Holy Light · Empowered] When Shield items grant a shield or heal, they also grant {C:ShieldSynergySystem.T3_CONVERT%}% of it as Holy Shield. Holy Light Shield items generate {C:ShieldSynergySystem.T3_SHIELD_BONUS%}% more Holy Shield"

msgid "每件药水为携带者提供 +6% 治疗强度、+6% 护盾强度、+2 最大龟能 · 【猎物】将生命值最高的敌人标记为猎物，龟蛋除外。猎物阵亡后 {C:PotionSynergySystem.PERIOD} 秒内重新标记。全队对猎物造成的伤害提高 {C:PotionSynergySystem.PREY_AMP[0]%}%"
msgstr "Each Potion gives its holder +6% Heal Power, +6% Shield Power and +2 Max Energy · [Prey] Marks the enemy with the highest health as Prey (Turtle Eggs excluded). A new Prey is marked within {C:PotionSynergySystem.PERIOD} seconds after it dies. Your team deals {C:PotionSynergySystem.PREY_AMP[0]%}% more damage to Prey"

msgid "每件药水为携带者提供 +12% 治疗强度、+12% 护盾强度、+4 最大龟能 · 【猎物】伤害提高至 {C:PotionSynergySystem.PREY_AMP[1]%}% · 【战利品】每击杀 1 名猎物，全队永久 +{C:PotionSynergySystem.HARVEST_ATK[1]} 攻击力，持续到本局结束"
msgstr "Each Potion gives its holder +12% Heal Power, +12% Shield Power and +4 Max Energy · [Prey] Bonus damage increased to {C:PotionSynergySystem.PREY_AMP[1]%}% · [Spoils] Each Prey killed gives your team a permanent +{C:PotionSynergySystem.HARVEST_ATK[1]} Attack until the match ends"

msgid "每件药水为携带者提供 +20% 治疗强度、+20% 护盾强度、+6 最大龟能 · 【猎物】伤害提高至 {C:PotionSynergySystem.PREY_AMP[2]%}% · 【战利品】每击杀 1 名猎物 +{C:PotionSynergySystem.HARVEST_ATK[2]} 攻击力"
msgstr "Each Potion gives its holder +20% Heal Power, +20% Shield Power and +6 Max Energy · [Prey] Bonus damage increased to {C:PotionSynergySystem.PREY_AMP[2]%}% · [Spoils] +{C:PotionSynergySystem.HARVEST_ATK[2]} Attack per Prey killed"

msgid "每件枪为携带者提供 +20% 攻击速度 · 【金弹】每把枪每射出 {C:GunSynergySystem.GOLD_EVERY[0]} 发子弹，额外射出 1 发金弹。金弹继承该枪子弹的全部效果，并额外造成本次伤害 {C:GunSynergySystem.GOLD_TRUE_PCT[0]%}% 的真实伤害 · 【炮台一】我方前方生成一座炮台，每 {C:GunSynergySystem.TICK} 秒对它与最近敌人连线上的所有敌人造成 {C:GunSynergySystem.T1_DMG} 物理伤害，无视护甲，并为生命值最低的友军回复造成伤害 {C:GunSynergySystem.T1_HEAL_SHARE%}% 的生命值"
msgstr "Each Gun gives its holder +20% Attack Speed · [Golden Bullet] Every {C:GunSynergySystem.GOLD_EVERY[0]} shots, each gun fires 1 extra Golden Bullet. It keeps all of that gun's bullet effects and deals bonus true damage equal to {C:GunSynergySystem.GOLD_TRUE_PCT[0]%}% of the hit · [Turret I] A turret appears at your front. Every {C:GunSynergySystem.TICK} seconds it deals {C:GunSynergySystem.T1_DMG} physical damage, ignoring armor, to all enemies on the line to the nearest enemy, and heals your lowest-health ally for {C:GunSynergySystem.T1_HEAL_SHARE%}% of the damage dealt"

msgid "每件枪为携带者提供 +40% 攻击速度 · 【金弹】每 {C:GunSynergySystem.GOLD_EVERY[1]} 发射出 1 发，额外造成 {C:GunSynergySystem.GOLD_TRUE_PCT[1]%}% 真实伤害 · 【炮台二】我方中心生成第二座炮台，每 {C:GunSynergySystem.T2_PERIOD} 秒产出 {C:GunSynergySystem.T2_BASE_ENERGY} 点能量，全队每件枪再 +{C:GunSynergySystem.T2_PER_GUN} 点。能量交替转化为全队均摊的护盾，或对敌方全体均摊的真实伤害"
msgstr "Each Gun gives its holder +40% Attack Speed · [Golden Bullet] 1 every {C:GunSynergySystem.GOLD_EVERY[1]} shots, dealing {C:GunSynergySystem.GOLD_TRUE_PCT[1]%}% bonus true damage · [Turret II] A second turret appears at your center. Every {C:GunSynergySystem.T2_PERIOD} seconds it produces {C:GunSynergySystem.T2_BASE_ENERGY} energy, +{C:GunSynergySystem.T2_PER_GUN} per Gun on your team. The energy alternates between a shield split across your team and true damage split across all enemies"

msgid "每件枪为携带者提供 +66% 攻击速度 · 【金弹】每 {C:GunSynergySystem.GOLD_EVERY[2]} 发射出 1 发，额外造成 {C:GunSynergySystem.GOLD_TRUE_PCT[2]%}% 真实伤害 · 【炮台三·火控】我方后方生成第三座炮台，使携带枪者额外造成 {C:GunSynergySystem.T3_BASE%}% 真实伤害，身上每件枪再 +{C:GunSynergySystem.T3_PER_GUN%}%"
msgstr "Each Gun gives its holder +66% Attack Speed · [Golden Bullet] 1 every {C:GunSynergySystem.GOLD_EVERY[2]} shots, dealing {C:GunSynergySystem.GOLD_TRUE_PCT[2]%}% bonus true damage · [Turret III · Fire Control] A third turret appears at your rear. Gun holders deal {C:GunSynergySystem.T3_BASE%}% bonus true damage, +{C:GunSynergySystem.T3_PER_GUN%}% per Gun on them"

msgid "每件弓箭为携带者提供 +9% 暴击率 · 【处决】全队攻击生命值低于 {C:BowSynergySystem.EXEC_BASE[0]%}% 的敌人时直接处决。攻击者暴击率的 {C:BowSynergySystem.CRIT_TO_LINE[0]%}% 计入这条处决线 · 【腐蚀】每 {C:BowSynergySystem.CORRODE_PERIOD} 秒，敌方全体叠加 1 层腐蚀，至多 {C:BowSynergySystem.CORRODE_MAX} 层。每层使其受到的伤害提高 {C:BowSynergySystem.CORRODE_PER_STACK[0]%}%，满层时受到的伤害有 {C:BowSynergySystem.CORRODE_TRUE_PCT[0]%}% 转化为真实伤害"
msgstr "Each Bow gives its holder +9% Crit Chance · [Execute] Your team's attacks execute enemies below {C:BowSynergySystem.EXEC_BASE[0]%}% health. {C:BowSynergySystem.CRIT_TO_LINE[0]%}% of the attacker's Crit Chance is added to this threshold · [Corrosion] Every {C:BowSynergySystem.CORRODE_PERIOD} seconds, all enemies gain 1 Corrosion stack, up to {C:BowSynergySystem.CORRODE_MAX}. Each stack makes them take {C:BowSynergySystem.CORRODE_PER_STACK[0]%}% more damage; at max stacks, {C:BowSynergySystem.CORRODE_TRUE_PCT[0]%}% of damage they take becomes true damage"

msgid "每件弓箭为携带者提供 +16% 暴击率 · 【处决】处决线提高至 {C:BowSynergySystem.EXEC_BASE[1]%}%，暴击率计入 {C:BowSynergySystem.CRIT_TO_LINE[1]%}% · 【腐蚀】每层提高至 {C:BowSynergySystem.CORRODE_PER_STACK[1]%}%，满层转化提高至 {C:BowSynergySystem.CORRODE_TRUE_PCT[1]%}%"
msgstr "Each Bow gives its holder +16% Crit Chance · [Execute] Threshold raised to {C:BowSynergySystem.EXEC_BASE[1]%}%, plus {C:BowSynergySystem.CRIT_TO_LINE[1]%}% of Crit Chance · [Corrosion] {C:BowSynergySystem.CORRODE_PER_STACK[1]%}% per stack; {C:BowSynergySystem.CORRODE_TRUE_PCT[1]%}% converted at max stacks"

msgid "每件弓箭为携带者提供 +22% 暴击率 · 【处决】处决线提高至 {C:BowSynergySystem.EXEC_BASE[2]%}%，暴击率计入 {C:BowSynergySystem.CRIT_TO_LINE[2]%}% · 【腐蚀】每层提高至 {C:BowSynergySystem.CORRODE_PER_STACK[2]%}%，满层转化提高至 {C:BowSynergySystem.CORRODE_TRUE_PCT[2]%}%"
msgstr "Each Bow gives its holder +22% Crit Chance · [Execute] Threshold raised to {C:BowSynergySystem.EXEC_BASE[2]%}%, plus {C:BowSynergySystem.CRIT_TO_LINE[2]%}% of Crit Chance · [Corrosion] {C:BowSynergySystem.CORRODE_PER_STACK[2]%}% per stack; {C:BowSynergySystem.CORRODE_TRUE_PCT[2]%}% converted at max stacks"

msgid "每件法器为携带者提供 +4 魔法穿透、+4 最大龟能 · 【法力】每件法器有独立的法力，充满 {C:StaffSynergySystem.MANA_FULL_BY_TIER[1]} 点时释放该法器的主动效果。每 {C:RealtimeBattle3DScene.EQ_TICK} 秒回复 {C:StaffSynergySystem.MANA_PER_TICK} 点，携带者造成或受到伤害时也会回复。未激活羁绊时需要 {C:StaffSynergySystem.MANA_FULL_BY_TIER[0]} 点"
msgstr "Each Artifact gives its holder +4 Magic Pen and +4 Max Energy · [Mana] Each Artifact has its own mana and casts its active effect at {C:StaffSynergySystem.MANA_FULL_BY_TIER[1]} mana. Regenerates {C:StaffSynergySystem.MANA_PER_TICK} every {C:RealtimeBattle3DScene.EQ_TICK} seconds, and also when the holder deals or takes damage. Needs {C:StaffSynergySystem.MANA_FULL_BY_TIER[0]} without the synergy active"

msgid "每件法器为携带者提供 +7 魔法穿透、+6 最大龟能 · 【法力】充满所需降低至 {C:StaffSynergySystem.MANA_FULL_BY_TIER[2]} 点"
msgstr "Each Artifact gives its holder +7 Magic Pen and +6 Max Energy · [Mana] Mana needed reduced to {C:StaffSynergySystem.MANA_FULL_BY_TIER[2]}"

msgid "每件法器为携带者提供 +11 魔法穿透、+8 最大龟能 · 【法力】充满所需降低至 {C:StaffSynergySystem.MANA_FULL_BY_TIER[3]} 点 · 【余韵】友军受到治疗时，额外获得相当于治疗量 {C:StaffSynergySystem.ECHO_PCT[2]%}% 的护盾"
msgstr "Each Artifact gives its holder +11 Magic Pen and +8 Max Energy · [Mana] Mana needed reduced to {C:StaffSynergySystem.MANA_FULL_BY_TIER[3]} · [Echo] When an ally is healed, it also gains a shield equal to {C:StaffSynergySystem.ECHO_PCT[2]%}% of the heal"

msgid "每件法器为携带者提供 +14 魔法穿透、+10 最大龟能 · 【法力】充满所需降低至 {C:StaffSynergySystem.MANA_FULL_BY_TIER[4]} 点 · 【余韵】提高至 {C:StaffSynergySystem.ECHO_PCT[3]%}% · 【共鸣】每 {C:StaffSynergySystem.RESONANCE_PERIOD} 秒，全队回复 {C:StaffSynergySystem.RESONANCE_HEAL%}% 最大生命值，并净化 {C:StaffSynergySystem.RESONANCE_DISPEL[3]} 种减益，依次为眩晕、减速、灼烧、中毒、诅咒"
msgstr "Each Artifact gives its holder +14 Magic Pen and +10 Max Energy · [Mana] Mana needed reduced to {C:StaffSynergySystem.MANA_FULL_BY_TIER[4]} · [Echo] Increased to {C:StaffSynergySystem.ECHO_PCT[3]%}% · [Resonance] Every {C:StaffSynergySystem.RESONANCE_PERIOD} seconds, your team heals {C:StaffSynergySystem.RESONANCE_HEAL%}% max health and cleanses {C:StaffSynergySystem.RESONANCE_DISPEL[3]} debuffs, in order: Stun, Slow, Burn, Poison, Curse"

msgid "每件灵物为携带者提供 +5% 闪避 · 【触手】召唤 {C:SpiritSynergySystem.TENTACLES[0]} 根无法被击杀的触手。触手每 {C:SpiritSynergySystem.SLAP_PERIOD} 秒获得 1 层拍击，无上限。射程内有敌人时消耗 1 层，朝最近的敌人拍下，对沿途敌人造成 {C:SpiritSynergySystem.HIT_FLAT} 外加 {C:SpiritSynergySystem.HIT_HP_PCT%}% 目标最大生命值的物理伤害 · 【亡灵】友方单位阵亡时原地召唤 1 只亡魂，继承其 {C:SpiritSynergySystem.WRAITH_INHERIT[0]%}% 攻击力与生命值，自动攻击最近的敌人"
msgstr "Each Spirit gives its holder +5% Dodge · [Tentacles] Summons {C:SpiritSynergySystem.TENTACLES[0]} unkillable tentacles. Each gains 1 Slap stack every {C:SpiritSynergySystem.SLAP_PERIOD} seconds, with no cap. With an enemy in range, it spends 1 stack to slam toward the nearest enemy, dealing {C:SpiritSynergySystem.HIT_FLAT} + {C:SpiritSynergySystem.HIT_HP_PCT%}% of the target's max health as physical damage to enemies in the path · [Undead] When an allied unit dies, a wraith rises in its place with {C:SpiritSynergySystem.WRAITH_INHERIT[0]%}% of its attack damage and health, and attacks the nearest enemy"

msgid "每件灵物为携带者提供 +9% 闪避 · 【触手】增加至 {C:SpiritSynergySystem.TENTACLES[1]} 根 · 【闪避蓄能】我方任一单位闪避成功时，每根触手获得 1 层拍击 · 【亡灵】继承提高至 {C:SpiritSynergySystem.WRAITH_INHERIT[1]%}%。亡魂阵亡后可再召唤 {C:SpiritSynergySystem.WRAITH_LOOPS[1]} 次，每次继承的属性为上一次的 {C:SpiritSynergySystem.WRAITH_DECAY%}%"
msgstr "Each Spirit gives its holder +9% Dodge · [Tentacles] Increased to {C:SpiritSynergySystem.TENTACLES[1]} · [Dodge Charge] Whenever any of your units dodges, each tentacle gains 1 Slap stack · [Undead] Inheritance increased to {C:SpiritSynergySystem.WRAITH_INHERIT[1]%}%. A dead wraith can rise {C:SpiritSynergySystem.WRAITH_LOOPS[1]} more times, each time with {C:SpiritSynergySystem.WRAITH_DECAY%}% of the previous stats"

msgid "每件灵物为携带者提供 +13% 闪避 · 【触手】拍击伤害变为原来的 {C:SpiritSynergySystem.HIT_MULT[2]%}% · 【亡灵】继承提高至 {C:SpiritSynergySystem.WRAITH_INHERIT[2]%}%，可再召唤 {C:SpiritSynergySystem.WRAITH_LOOPS[2]} 次"
msgstr "Each Spirit gives its holder +13% Dodge · [Tentacles] Slap damage becomes {C:SpiritSynergySystem.HIT_MULT[2]%}% · [Undead] Inheritance increased to {C:SpiritSynergySystem.WRAITH_INHERIT[2]%}%, can rise {C:SpiritSynergySystem.WRAITH_LOOPS[2]} more times"

msgid "每件灵物为携带者提供 +18% 闪避 · 【触手】拍击伤害变为原来的 {C:SpiritSynergySystem.HIT_MULT[3]%}% · 【亡灵】继承提高至 {C:SpiritSynergySystem.WRAITH_INHERIT[3]%}%，可再召唤 {C:SpiritSynergySystem.WRAITH_LOOPS[3]} 次"
msgstr "Each Spirit gives its holder +18% Dodge · [Tentacles] Slap damage becomes {C:SpiritSynergySystem.HIT_MULT[3]%}% · [Undead] Inheritance increased to {C:SpiritSynergySystem.WRAITH_INHERIT[3]%}%, can rise {C:SpiritSynergySystem.WRAITH_LOOPS[3]} more times"

msgid "【刻痕】携带者每造成 {C:IncenseStoneSystem.PER_MARK} 点伤害，刻下 1 道刻痕，至多 {C:IncenseStoneSystem.MARK_CAP} 道，跨对局保留，赛季重置。多件香火石共用同一份刻痕 · 每道刻痕使携带者获得 {C:IncenseStoneSystem.ITEM_AMP%}% 增伤与 {C:IncenseStoneSystem.ITEM_DR%}% 减伤，全队获得 {C:IncenseStoneSystem.TEAM_AMP%}% 增伤与 {C:IncenseStoneSystem.TEAM_DR%}% 减伤"
msgstr "[Engraving] For every {C:IncenseStoneSystem.PER_MARK} damage the holder deals, it carves 1 Engraving, up to {C:IncenseStoneSystem.MARK_CAP}. Engravings carry over between matches and reset each Season. Multiple Incense Stones share the same Engravings · Each Engraving gives the holder {C:IncenseStoneSystem.ITEM_AMP%}% Damage Amp and {C:IncenseStoneSystem.ITEM_DR%}% Damage Reduction, and the whole team {C:IncenseStoneSystem.TEAM_AMP%}% Damage Amp and {C:IncenseStoneSystem.TEAM_DR%}% Damage Reduction"

msgid "商店每次刷新至少出现一把小木斧的概率为 {C:AxeEvolution.SHELF_P_BASE%}%，本大轮每多打一局提高 {C:AxeEvolution.SHELF_P_PER_MATCH%}%，至多 {C:AxeEvolution.SHELF_P_CAP%}% · 重复买到的小木斧转化为砍伐经验"
msgstr "Each shop refresh has a {C:AxeEvolution.SHELF_P_BASE%}% chance to offer at least one Little Wooden Axe, +{C:AxeEvolution.SHELF_P_PER_MATCH%}% per match played this Season, up to {C:AxeEvolution.SHELF_P_CAP%}% · Duplicate Little Wooden Axes turn into Chopping XP"

msgid "每件遗物为携带者提供 +3% 生命偷取 · 【生死界】我方全体单位生命值高于 {C:RelicSynergySystem.HP_GATE%}% 时攻击力提高 {C:RelicSynergySystem.ATK_BONUS[0]%}%，低于 {C:RelicSynergySystem.HP_GATE%}% 时获得 {C:RelicSynergySystem.LOW_HP_LS[0]%}% 生命偷取"
msgstr "Each Relic gives its holder +3% Lifesteal · [Life and Death] Your units gain {C:RelicSynergySystem.ATK_BONUS[0]%}% attack damage above {C:RelicSynergySystem.HP_GATE%}% health, and {C:RelicSynergySystem.LOW_HP_LS[0]%}% Lifesteal below {C:RelicSynergySystem.HP_GATE%}%"

msgid "每件遗物为携带者提供 +5% 生命偷取 · 【生死界】攻击力提高至 {C:RelicSynergySystem.ATK_BONUS[1]%}%，生命偷取提高至 {C:RelicSynergySystem.LOW_HP_LS[1]%}% · 【远古之力】每 {C:RelicSynergySystem.PERIOD} 秒，全队永久 +{C:RelicSynergySystem.ANCIENT_PER_TICK[1]%}% 增伤，至多 {C:RelicSynergySystem.ANCIENT_CAP[1]%}%，持续到本局结束 · 【龟蛋加固】我方龟蛋 +{C:RelicSynergySystem.EGG_HP[1]} 最大生命值，并以 {C:RelicSynergySystem.EGG_ATK[1]} 攻击力还击射程 {C:RelicSynergySystem.EGG_RANGE} 内的敌人"
msgstr "Each Relic gives its holder +5% Lifesteal · [Life and Death] Attack damage bonus increased to {C:RelicSynergySystem.ATK_BONUS[1]%}%, Lifesteal to {C:RelicSynergySystem.LOW_HP_LS[1]%}% · [Ancient Power] Every {C:RelicSynergySystem.PERIOD} seconds, your team permanently gains +{C:RelicSynergySystem.ANCIENT_PER_TICK[1]%}% Damage Amp, up to {C:RelicSynergySystem.ANCIENT_CAP[1]%}%, until the match ends · [Fortified Egg] Your Turtle Egg gains +{C:RelicSynergySystem.EGG_HP[1]} Max Health and strikes back at enemies within {C:RelicSynergySystem.EGG_RANGE} range with {C:RelicSynergySystem.EGG_ATK[1]} Attack"

msgid "每件遗物为携带者提供 +8% 生命偷取 · 【生死界】攻击力提高至 {C:RelicSynergySystem.ATK_BONUS[2]%}%，生命偷取提高至 {C:RelicSynergySystem.LOW_HP_LS[2]%}% · 【远古之力】每次 +{C:RelicSynergySystem.ANCIENT_PER_TICK[2]%}%，至多 {C:RelicSynergySystem.ANCIENT_CAP[2]%}% · 【龟蛋加固】+{C:RelicSynergySystem.EGG_HP[2]} 最大生命值，还击攻击力 {C:RelicSynergySystem.EGG_ATK[2]}"
msgstr "Each Relic gives its holder +8% Lifesteal · [Life and Death] Attack damage bonus increased to {C:RelicSynergySystem.ATK_BONUS[2]%}%, Lifesteal to {C:RelicSynergySystem.LOW_HP_LS[2]%}% · [Ancient Power] +{C:RelicSynergySystem.ANCIENT_PER_TICK[2]%}% each time, up to {C:RelicSynergySystem.ANCIENT_CAP[2]%}% · [Fortified Egg] +{C:RelicSynergySystem.EGG_HP[2]} Max Health, strike-back Attack {C:RelicSynergySystem.EGG_ATK[2]}"

msgid "每件遗物为携带者提供 +10% 生命偷取 · 【生死界】攻击力提高至 {C:RelicSynergySystem.ATK_BONUS[3]%}%，生命偷取提高至 {C:RelicSynergySystem.LOW_HP_LS[3]%}% · 【远古之力】每次 +{C:RelicSynergySystem.ANCIENT_PER_TICK[3]%}%，至多 {C:RelicSynergySystem.ANCIENT_CAP[3]%}% · 【龟蛋加固】+{C:RelicSynergySystem.EGG_HP[3]} 最大生命值，还击攻击力 {C:RelicSynergySystem.EGG_ATK[3]} · 【觉醒】每个战场开始 {C:RelicSynergySystem.AWAKEN_SEC} 秒后，已累积的远古之力提高 {C:RelicSynergySystem.AWAKEN_BOOST%}%"
msgstr "Each Relic gives its holder +10% Lifesteal · [Life and Death] Attack damage bonus increased to {C:RelicSynergySystem.ATK_BONUS[3]%}%, Lifesteal to {C:RelicSynergySystem.LOW_HP_LS[3]%}% · [Ancient Power] +{C:RelicSynergySystem.ANCIENT_PER_TICK[3]%}% each time, up to {C:RelicSynergySystem.ANCIENT_CAP[3]%}% · [Fortified Egg] +{C:RelicSynergySystem.EGG_HP[3]} Max Health, strike-back Attack {C:RelicSynergySystem.EGG_ATK[3]} · [Awakening] {C:RelicSynergySystem.AWAKEN_SEC} seconds into each battle, accumulated Ancient Power is increased by {C:RelicSynergySystem.AWAKEN_BOOST%}%"

